# App workflow (oval)

Stack: **Next.js App Router**, **Better Auth** (`lib/auth/`), **Drizzle** (`lib/db/`), **Biome**.

## Layout

- Public routes: `app/` (home, login, future feed).
- Protected: `app/cabinet/` (any signed-in user), `app/admin/` (capability `admin.access`: roles `admin` | `super_admin`, `lib/auth/capabilities.ts`).
- Auth handler: `app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts` — do not fork Better Auth routes manually.
- Business logic: prefer `lib/*` modules; keep route files thin.
- Feed card UI: `components/nl/feed-card/` (facade `NlFeedPostCard` re-exported from `feed-post-card.tsx`). Admin create/edit: `components/admin/publication-editor.tsx` (modes `news` / `announcement` / `training`) + preview mapper `lib/admin/publication-preview.ts`.
- Admin is training-first. `ADMIN_HOME = "/admin"` (`lib/admin/routes.ts`) is the «Сегодня» screen: the current/next training (`listCurrentAndNextSessions`, a training without `ends_at` lasts 2 h), «Требует внимания» (`listAttentionSessions`, same rule as `sessionNeedsAttention`) and the next trainings; it is the single entry link for redirects, header and tab bar. The menu is grouped by task (`buildAdminMenu(role)`: Тренировки / Люди / Деньги / Контент / Система, filtered by `can`), rendered by `components/admin/admin-nav.tsx` with `aria-current`; `/admin` matches only exactly. `/admin/sessions` «Расписание» (upcoming from the nearest) → `/admin/sessions/[id]` with tabs `list` / `settings` / `posts` / `journal` (`app/admin/sessions/[id]/tabs.ts`; legacy `participants` / `history` still parse); reschedule and cancel live in the header «…» menu. Participants are a phone-first row list (`SessionParticipantsList`): name + status, the main action as a button («Оплачено»), the rest in «…» (`AdminMenu`, `components/admin/admin-menu.tsx`; dialogs open from menu items via `inMenu` / `triggerRole="menuitem"`). Posts are the communication layer (`/admin/posts`); `/admin/registrations` — participants (search, history); `/admin/payments` — «Ждут оплаты» / «Возвраты» with row actions. Admin lists are paginated server-side (`lib/admin/pagination.ts`, `?page=`, default 10).
- Page primitives in `components/nl/ui.tsx` — `PageHeader`, `BackLink`, `Section`, `ListRows` / `ListRow`, `Muted`, `ErrorText` — instead of inline styles (`color: var(--ink-muted)`, hand-made «← …» links); new surfaces with their own background go into the dark-plate list in `app/tg-mini-app.css`.
- Training domain ops: `lib/training/session-service.ts` (no auth/revalidate — covered by integration tests); server actions in `lib/admin/session-actions.ts`, `lib/admin/registration-actions.ts`; admin queries in `lib/training/admin-queries.ts`. After any registration change a server action calls `applyRegistrationEffects(sessionIds)` (`lib/app/effects.ts`: revalidate feed / cabinet / admin + SSE per session) — no hand-picked `revalidatePath` lists for registrations.

## Auth / email OTP

- Server auth: `lib/auth/index.ts`, session helper `lib/auth/session.ts`.
- Client: `lib/auth/client.ts` only in `"use client"` components.
- OTP delivery: `lib/email/send-otp.ts` (`stub` / `recording` / `smtp` via `EMAIL_PROVIDER`); SMTP limits in `lib/email/otp-send-limits.ts` + `email_otp_send_log`. Prod Postbox: [`docs/engineering/email.md`](../../docs/engineering/email.md).
- Email normalize: `lib/auth/email.ts`.
- Auth rate limits: Better Auth `rateLimit` / `emailOTP.rateLimit` in `lib/auth/index.ts`; `BETTER_AUTH_TRUSTED_PROXIES` via `lib/auth/trusted-proxies.ts`.
- CLI / schema: root `auth.ts` re-exports auth for `pnpm run auth:generate`.
- **Telegram channel:** autopublish при выходе поста в ленту — `publish_to_telegram` + `TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID`, `lib/bots/telegram/publish-feed-post.ts`. Исходящий Bot API: `lib/bots/telegram/api.ts`, опц. **`TELEGRAM_API_ROOT`** (proxy). Очередь: `feed_post_social_publishes` (`lib/feed/social-publish-jobs.ts`); `after()` + догон `lib/feed/social-publish-sweep.ts`; замок на пост — `lib/bots/social-publish/in-flight-lock.ts`; лимит 10/час — `lib/bots/social-publish/rate-limit.ts`; ретраи — `SOCIAL_PUBLISH_MAX_RETRIES` (default 3).
- **Telegram login:** OIDC (`TELEGRAM_OIDC_*`) — `/telegram/oidc/start`, `/sign-in/telegram/oidc`, GET `/sign-in/telegram/oidc/callback`; серверные `/token` и JWKS — опц. **`TELEGRAM_OIDC_ROOT`** (браузерный `/auth` на oauth.telegram.org); bot deep link — `/telegram/login-intent`, `/sign-in/telegram/bot`; webhook `app/api/webhooks/telegram/route.ts`. **Mini App:** `POST /sign-in/telegram/mini-app` (`initData`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`), клиент [`components/telegram/telegram-mini-app-provider.tsx`](../../components/telegram/telegram-mini-app-provider.tsx), deep link `start_param` — [`lib/telegram/mini-app-start-param.ts`](../../lib/telegram/mini-app-start-param.ts), опц. `TELEGRAM_MINI_APP_SHORT_NAME`. `user.email` nullable для TG-first.
- **VK ID:** `VK_CLIENT_ID` + `VK_CLIENT_SECRET`. Кнопка на `/login` скрыта без них. Старт `POST /vk/oauth/start`, callback `GET /callback/vk` (редирект `https://<host>/api/auth/callback/vk`). Есть email — привязка к существующему пользователю; нет — `email: null`, `providerId: vk`. **Кабинет → «Способы входа»:** привязка email / Telegram / VK (`linkToken` в OAuth state); конфликт — склейка в текущего user (`lib/auth/merge-users.ts`), источник — `user.deleted_at` + удаление всех `session`. Два `pending`/`succeeded` платежа за одну тренировку блокируют склейку.

## Database

- Schema: `lib/db/schema/` — `auth-schema.ts` generated; extend via `index.ts` exports when adding app tables.
- Migrations: `drizzle/` via `pnpm run db:generate` + `pnpm run db:migrate`. Drizzle runs all pending migrations in **one transaction**: a new enum value cannot be used in the same run — recreate the enum (rename → create → `ALTER COLUMN … TYPE … USING`) when backfill needs it.
- **No hard deletes of domain data**: posts → `status = unpublished`; trainings → only `cancelled` (no delete); registrations → `status = cancelled` + `cancelled_by` (re-registering inserts a new row); post photos → `removed_at`. Domain FKs are `ON DELETE RESTRICT`; no `db.delete` on domain tables.
- **Registration model** (`lib/domain/registration/`): two independent axes — participation `status` (`active` | `cancelled`, `cancelled_by`: user / admin / session_cancelled / transferred) and money `payment_state` (`free` | `due` | `paid` | `refunded` | `moved`; source of truth for money stays `payments`). Never compare these strings on screens: labels, colour and available actions come from `describeRegistration({ registration, session, viewer, now })`, and services check the same `actions` before acting. Partial unique `registrations_user_session_active_uidx` (one **active** row per user+session); closed rows stay as history. Every change writes `registration_events` in the same transaction (`insertRegistrationEvents`, with actor); shown in the training «История» tab.
- **Attendance** (third axis, `lib/domain/attendance/`): `registrations.attendance` (`unknown` | `attended` | `no_show` | `excused`, + `attendance_marked_at/by`) and `source` (`self` | `coach`). Window: from `gather_at` (else 1 h before start) until `ATTENDANCE_GRACE_DAYS` (3) days after the end (`ends_at` or start + 2 h); after that only `attendance.markLate` (super_admin), marking needs `attendance.mark`. Use `markAttendance` / `markRestNoShow` / `addWalkIn` (walk-in bypasses capacity and the registration window, not the attendance window); each writes `attendance_marked` to `registration_events`. An unpaid no-show (or excused) is just a mark — no debt, no auto-cancel: `isAbsent` → staff label «Без оплаты» (grey), excluded from `unpaid` / «Ждут оплаты» / attention, and «Оплачено» moves from the row button into «…». Actions in `lib/admin/attendance-actions.ts` return `{ status }` (no redirect) and call `applyRegistrationEffects(..., { attendance: true })`, which also emits SSE `session.attendance_changed` (`SessionLiveRefresh` refreshes the coach list; the feed ignores it). Time-based changes (window opens, start, end, window closes — `attendanceMoments`) re-render without reload via `RefreshAt` (`components/admin/refresh-at.tsx`: `setTimeout` on server time + catch-up on `visibilitychange` / `focus`), used on the training page and «Сегодня». Participants see «Был / Пропустил» in the cabinet only; the public roster doesn't show attendance.
- **Participant rules**: registration closes at `startsAt` (`isRegistrationOpen`); a participant cancels only unpaid/free registrations before start, paid ones go through the coach (refund/transfer in `/admin/payments`); staff can't remove a paid registration either — only refund or transfer. Participant pages always call `cancelUserRegistration(..., "participant")` whatever the user's role; `"staff"` only from `lib/admin/*`. Only announcement cards register/pay/cancel; reschedule/cancel cards link to the announcement. Staff (`canManageSessionFromFeed`: `registrations.manage` or `attendance.mark`) get «Управлять →» on every training card in the feed and on `/feed/[id]` (`manageHref` → `adminSessionHref(sessionId)`); participants never see it.
- **Scheduled publishing**: `status = published` + future `published_at`. Anything shown to readers must use `livePostCondition()` / `isPostLive()` from `lib/feed/publication.ts`, not `status = published`. `lib/feed/scheduled-publisher.ts` (started in `instrumentation.ts`, 30 s tick) only pushes SSE events and applies the pin at release time.
- Training ↔ posts: posts reference the training via `feed_posts.related_session_id` (announcement, reschedule, cancel; max one announcement per training). Training changes are logged in `training_session_events`.
- Local dev: `pnpm run task -- dev-up` — Postgres + **Next.js in Docker** (profile **oval-dev**, PG **5433**, app **3000**). Compose [`.docker/`](../../.docker/); [`scripts/task.ts`](../../scripts/task.ts) / [`Makefile`](../../Makefile).
- Git hooks: **Lefthook** pre-commit → lint + `typecheck` + unit (`validate-full` — CI); [`docs/engineering/local-dev.md`](../../docs/engineering/local-dev.md).
- VPS prod: [`.deploy/`](../../.deploy/) + GitHub Actions `deploy-vps.yml` (unit + integration, затем GHCR, SSH, Traefik); см. [`.deploy/README.md`](../../.deploy/README.md).
- Integration stack: **oval-integration** (`pnpm run task -- test-integration`, `EMAIL_PROVIDER=recording`); e2e: **oval-e2e** + **MailSlurper** (`pnpm run task -- test-e2e`) — Playwright в `tests/e2e/` (OTP через MailSlurper API, seed/оплаты/TG через `tests/e2e/helpers/*` и `DATABASE_URL`). В профиле e2e: `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` + `TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME` (bot deep link).
- Payments: `lib/payments/`, webhook `app/api/webhooks/payment/[provider]/route.ts`, docs [`docs/engineering/payments.md`](../../docs/engineering/payments.md). Mock confirm — admin only. `payments.method` (`online` | `cash` | `bank_transfer` | `moved`): staff «Оплачено» opens a dialog with two big buttons «Наличными» / «Переводом» (submit `method` → `markRegistrationPaid({ method })`, stored in `confirmPaymentSucceeded` and in the `payment_succeeded` event); shown as «· наличными / · переводом» next to the amount. One payment per registration (`payments.registration_id` unique); `resetPaymentForRetry` only repairs legacy rows re-used before the partial unique (removed with payment attempts, roadmap step 5).

## Roles

- Three roles: `user` (default), `admin`, `super_admin`. **super_admin** назначает **user** / **admin** на `/admin/users`. Роль **super_admin** — только прямое обновление `user.role` в БД.
- Better Auth **admin** plugin: `adminRoles: ["admin"]`. Product RBAC — capabilities, not roles: `can(role, capability)` (`lib/auth/capabilities.ts`, map role → capabilities), server actions guard with `requireCapability(...)` (`lib/admin/require-capability.ts`), admin menu items are filtered by capability. Never compare role strings for access; a new role = a new set of existing capabilities. `isSuperAdmin` only for role invariants (super_admin can't be changed or merged as a source). **admin** — everything except `users.manageRoles` / `users.merge` (`/admin/users`, `/admin/users/merge`), which only **super_admin** has.
